OL,3,GNEWSAHuman remains found under former
OL,4,Ashopping centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FHuman remains thought to date back
OL,7,Fcenturies have been found during
OL,8,Fdemolition work on a former shopping
OL,9,Fcentre.
OL,11,FAnglia Square in Norwich is being torn
OL,12,Fdown as part of plans to build 1,100
OL,13,Fnew homes, mostly flats, along with
OL,14,Funits for retail and leisure.
OL,16,FThe city council, which is in charge of
OL,17,Fthe project, said "a small number of
OL,18,Fremains associated with part of a
OL,19,Fmedieval churchyard" had been
OL,20,Funearthed.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
