OL,3,GNEWSAHuman remains found under former
OL,4,Ashopping centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesman added the remains would be
OL,7,Fhandled with the "utmost care and
OL,8,Frespect" but would not slow down work
OL,9,Fat the site.
